{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-64884-r4515280","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Date Squares","sourcePageId":64884,"sourceRevision":"4515280","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-19T03:08:01Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Date%20Squares&oldid=4515280","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:41:34.045Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cookies","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using baking soda","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using date","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using oat","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"9b24fe13d27e7f99e20864f89481de2257a459eb9ea9acca59bcf11dd85cb310","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Confection recipes|time=50–55 minutes|difficulty=2}}\n__NOTOC__\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Confections|Confections]]\n\nA wonderful square recipe with the flavor of dates. Also see the [[Cookbook:Date Bar|Date Bar]] recipe.\n\n==Ingredients==\n===Crumb mixture===\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (360 g) rolled [[Cookbook:oats|oats]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 g) [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]] (packed)\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (260 g) [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] of melted [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n\n===Filling===\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] (480 g) [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:date|dates]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (120 g) [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]] \n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:water|water]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Margarine|lemon juice]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#In a [[Cookbook:Mixing Bowl|mixing bowl]], combine rolled oats, 1 cup brown sugar, flour, baking soda, salt and melted butter. Mix until crumbly.\n#Press half the crumb mixture into a parchment-lined and greased square [[Cookbook:Baking Pan|baking pan]].\n#In a saucepan over low heat, cook dates, sugar and water until thickened and smooth (about 10 minutes).\n#Add lemon juice and mix well.\n#Spread date mixture over crumble layer.\n#Sprinkle remaining crumb mixture over date filling.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at [[Cookbook:Oven Temperatures|350°F]] (180°C) for about 35 minutes, until lightly browned.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Recipes using date]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oat]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Date Squares","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 ½ cup (360 g) rolled oats","sourceText":"1 ½ cup (360 g) rolled oats","amountText":"1 ½ cup (360 g) rolled oats","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBindi